# mbsync config: UTD Microsoft 365 + Gmail (both XOAUTH2 via oama)

IMAPAccount utdallas
Host outlook.office365.com
Port 993
User dal558183@utdallas.edu
PassCmd "oama access dal558183@utdallas.edu"
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore utdallas-remote
Account utdallas

MaildirStore utdallas-local
Path ~/docs/mail/utdallas/
Inbox ~/docs/mail/utdallas/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel utdallas
Far :utdallas-remote:
Near :utdallas-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "Sent Items" "Archive"
Create Both
SyncState *
Expunge Near

# --- Gmail (XOAUTH2 via oama) ---

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User harrisonhenry916@gmail.com
PassCmd "oama access harrisonhenry916@gmail.com"
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/docs/mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/docs/mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail" "[Gmail]/All Mail"
Create Both
SyncState *
Expunge Near
